Thu Nov 18 13:00:05 2026 daemon.notice netifd: Interface 'wwan' is setting up now
Thu Nov 18 13:00:06 2026 daemon.err wpa_supplicant[2141]: wlan1: CTRL-EVENT-EAP-STARTED EAP authentication started
Thu Nov 18 13:00:07 2026 daemon.err wpa_supplicant[2141]: wlan1: CTRL-EVENT-EAP-FAILURE EAP authentication failed
Thu Nov 18 13:00:08 2026 daemon.notice wpa_supplicant[2141]: wlan1: CTRL-EVENT-DISCONNECTED bssid=00:11:22:33:44:55 reason=3
Thu Nov 18 13:00:09 2026 daemon.err wpa_supplicant[2141]: wlan1: Association request to the driver failed
Thu Nov 18 13:00:10 2026 daemon.warn hostapd: wlan0: STA deauth from 00:aa:bb:cc:dd:ee
EOF
